+## Inputs and preservation boundaries
+
+The executable input is the complete bundled `visium_human_pancreas_sub`
+object: 5,000 genes and all 1,986 packaged tissue spots from human PanIN sample
+GSM8058244, study [GSE254829](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE254829).
