+## Optional: round-trip through Giotto
+
+SCOP chooses the official `GiottoClass` v4/v5 converters for the installed
+Seurat major version. A single image can be resolved automatically; multiple
+images require `image =`. Normalize before export because the official reverse
+converter needs a nonempty normalized layer. This does not replace raw counts.
 
-SeuratObject::Images(spatial_from_giotto)
